  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Gain Norgu\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Realm of Torment Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Norgu\" title=\"Norgu\">Norgu</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Throne_of_Secrets\" title=\"Throne of Secrets\">Throne of Secrets</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate\">Abaddon's Gate</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Followed by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Worst._Performance._Ever.\" title=\"Worst. Performance. Ever.\">Worst. Performance. Ever.</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">Secondary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Fast acquisition of <a href=\"/wiki/Norgu\" title=\"Norgu\">Norgu</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Information\">Quest Information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest Information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Only available if you have not recruited <a href=\"/wiki/Norgu\" title=\"Norgu\">Norgu</a> before and do not have <a href=\"/wiki/The_Role_of_a_Lifetime\" title=\"The Role of a Lifetime\">The Role of a Lifetime</a> active.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Make arrangements with <a href=\"/wiki/Korvus\" title=\"Korvus\">Korvus</a> to perform Norgu's Nightfall.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>2,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Norgu\" title=\"Norgu\">Norgu</a> joins your party.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Map back to <a href=\"/wiki/Elona\" title=\"Elona\">Elona</a>, then map to <a href=\"/wiki/Honur_Hill\" title=\"Honur Hill\">Honur Hill</a>. Speak with <a href=\"/wiki/Korvus\" title=\"Korvus\">Korvus</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Norgu</dt>\n<dd><i>I remember you from Vabbi, yes? That's precisely what I thought. I'm writing a play about your adventures called \"Norgu's Nightfall\". To write it, though, I need to hear the real stories! I'd like to join your troupe, interview you, and get the real story for my play. But, first you'll need to go sign an <b>agreement</b> at <b>Honur Hill</b> so I can write it without worrying about silly things like...oh...royalties. Will you do that?</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"Of course I'll sign away my rights. This is for posterity, right?\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"No way. I know how this works. I sign and three months from now I'm played by a guy in a gorilla suit.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"You still need to go see <b>Korvus</b> in <b>Honur Hill</b> and sign that <b>agreement</b> so I can write your play!\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Norgu&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Korvus</dt>\n<dd><i>You're here to sign the contract for Norgu's play? Excellent. I'm looking forward to seeing \"Norgu's Nightfall.\" I just hope it's not another play about food.</i></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008140429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 324/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3608/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1537/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.142      1 -total\n 53.45%    8.093      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 45.42%    6.877      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n 16.21%    2.454      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n 12.08%    1.829      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n 11.00%    1.665      1 Template:No\n  9.52%    1.442      1 Template:Yes\n  9.14%    1.384      1 Template:Ask\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:25710-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008140429 and revision id 2481143.\n -->\n</div>"
